[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8644.349, "timestamp": "02:24:04", "text": "。讓我們祈禱一切順利。如果開發人員的問題已經解決，那就沒問題了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8648.389, "timestamp": "02:24:08", "text": "否則，就會感到疼痛。  我們來玩右星遊戲吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8656.27, "timestamp": "02:24:16", "text": "碲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8680.51, "timestamp": "02:24:40", "text": "[音樂]"}]